    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "mill", "x": 700, "y": 160, "width": 520, "height": 470,
      "strokeColor": "#b45309", "backgroundColor": "#fffbeb", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250015, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250016, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "mill_t", "x": 722, "y": 178, "width": 476, "height": 434,
      "text": "YamlPipelineFactory, in order\n\n1  merge every *.yaml under the folder\n   tree, so one pipeline can span files\n\n2  discover step kinds by reflection over\n   [YamlStepTag]  -  !LlmStep is a tag, not\n   a type: property, so a new step kind\n   needs no parser change\n\n3  deserialize with YamlDotNet, using a\n   DI-powered object factory\n\n4  SchemaCompiler turns each schema into\n   real types with Roslyn, in memory\n\n5  fail-fast validation  -  see below\n\n6  topologically order the steps",
      "originalText": "YamlPipelineFactory, in order\n\n1  merge every *.yaml under the folder\n   tree, so one pipeline can span files\n\n2  discover step kinds by reflection over\n   [YamlStepTag]  -  !LlmStep is a tag, not\n   a type: property, so a new step kind\n   needs no parser change\n\n3  deserialize with YamlDotNet, using a\n   DI-powered object factory\n\n4  SchemaCompiler turns each schema into\n   real types with Roslyn, in memory\n\n5  fail-fast validation  -  see below\n\n6  topologically order the steps",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250017, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250018, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "out", "x": 1320, "y": 160, "width": 560, "height": 240,
      "strokeColor": "#6d28d9", "backgroundColor": "#ddd6fe", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250019, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250020, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "out_t", "x": 1342, "y": 178, "width": 516, "height": 208,
      "text": "What Roslyn emits, per schema\n\nClassificationOutputData\n  a pure POCO, generated by\n  NJsonSchema and renamed\n\nClassificationOutput\n  : LlmStepResult<...Data>\n  the wrapper that flows through\n  the pipeline as an ordinary\n  IStepResult",
      "originalText": "What Roslyn emits, per schema\n\nClassificationOutputData\n  a pure POCO, generated by\n  NJsonSchema and renamed\n\nClassificationOutput\n  : LlmStepResult<...Data>\n  the wrapper that flows through\n  the pipeline as an ordinary\n  IStepResult",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#5b21b6", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250021, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250022, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "why", "x": 1320, "y": 430, "width": 560, "height": 200,
      "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#ecfdf5", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250023, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250024, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "why_t", "x": 1342, "y": 448, "width": 516, "height": 164,
      "text": "Why bother compiling\n\nThe engine, the middleware, the retry\nvalidation and the telemetry all see the\nsame strongly typed result whether the\nstep was written in C# or declared in\nYAML. Nothing downstream has a\nspecial path for dynamic steps, because\nthere are none.",
      "originalText": "Why bother compiling\n\nThe engine, the middleware, the retry\nvalidation and the telemetry all see the\nsame strongly typed result whether the\nstep was written in C# or declared in\nYAML. Nothing downstream has a\nspecial path for dynamic steps, because\nthere are none.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#065f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250025, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250026, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

