    { "type": "text", "id": "gate_h", "x": 80, "y": 680, "width": 900, "height": 22,
      "text": "The gate: five ways to be rejected before a single token is spent",
      "originalText": "The gate: five ways to be rejected before a single token is spent",
      "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250033, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250034, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "gate", "x": 80, "y": 716, "width": 1800, "height": 176,
      "strokeColor": "#b91c1c", "backgroundColor": "#fef2f2", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 3, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250035, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250036, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "gate_t", "x": 104, "y": 734, "width": 1752, "height": 140,
      "text": "unknown dependency    a dependsOn naming a step that is not in the pipeline\ncycle                 found by topological sort, not at runtime\nschema mismatch       a step's inputSchema must equal the outputSchema of what it depends on\nunknown role          profileName must name a role in LlmEnvironment; the error lists the ones that exist\nmissing schema        inputSchema and outputSchema are both required\n\nThe point of the gate is arithmetic: discovering a schema mismatch three LLM calls in costs money and time.",
      "originalText": "unknown dependency    a dependsOn naming a step that is not in the pipeline\ncycle                 found by topological sort, not at runtime\nschema mismatch       a step's inputSchema must equal the outputSchema of what it depends on\nunknown role          profileName must name a role in LlmEnvironment; the error lists the ones that exist\nmissing schema        inputSchema and outputSchema are both required\n\nThe point of the gate is arithmetic: discovering a schema mismatch three LLM calls in costs money and time.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250037, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250038, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "js", "x": 1960, "y": 160, "width": 600, "height": 300,
      "strokeColor": "#1e3a5f", "backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250039, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250040, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "js_t", "x": 1982, "y": 178, "width": 556, "height": 264,
      "text": "Validation JSON Schema cannot express\n\nA schema may carry a JavaScript\nfunction:\n\n  validate(self, context)\n\nrun with ClearScript V8 after the model\nresponds. It receives the whole\nPipelineContext, so a field can be checked\nagainst what an earlier step produced  -\nthe kind of cross-step rule no JSON\nSchema can state.\n\nA failure is fed back to the model as a\nretry, exactly like a C# validator.",
      "originalText": "Validation JSON Schema cannot express\n\nA schema may carry a JavaScript\nfunction:\n\n  validate(self, context)\n\nrun with ClearScript V8 after the model\nresponds. It receives the whole\nPipelineContext, so a field can be checked\nagainst what an earlier step produced  -\nthe kind of cross-step rule no JSON\nSchema can state.\n\nA failure is fed back to the model as a\nretry, exactly like a C# validator.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250041, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250042, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "sec", "x": 1960, "y": 490, "width": 600, "height": 140,
      "strokeColor": "#047857", "backgroundColor": "#a7f3d0", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250043, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250044, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "sec_t", "x": 1982, "y": 508, "width": 556, "height": 104,
      "text": "No secrets in a pipeline file\nA step names a role, never a key or an\nendpoint. Credentials stay in configuration\nand are resolved through LlmEnvironment,\nso a YAML file is safe to commit.",
      "originalText": "No secrets in a pipeline file\nA step names a role, never a key or an\nendpoint. Credentials stay in configuration\nand are resolved through LlmEnvironment,\nso a YAML file is safe to commit.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#065f46", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250045, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250046, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "lim", "x": 1960, "y": 660, "width": 600, "height": 232,
      "strokeColor": "#dc2626", "backgroundColor": "#fee2e2", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250047, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250048, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "roundness": {"type": 3} },
    { "type": "text", "id": "lim_t", "x": 1982, "y": 678, "width": 556, "height": 194,
      "text": "What compiling costs you\n\nEvery start recompiles: there is no\non-disk cache keyed by schema hash, so\nstartup pays for Roslyn each time.\n\nEach JavaScript validation creates its own\nV8 engine, with no pooling.\n\nYamlPipeline.ExecuteAsync accepts a\nCancellationToken and does not pass it\non, so a YAML run is not cancellable.",
      "originalText": "What compiling costs you\n\nEvery start recompiles: there is no\non-disk cache keyed by schema hash, so\nstartup pays for Roslyn each time.\n\nEach JavaScript validation creates its own\nV8 engine, with no pooling.\n\nYamlPipeline.ExecuteAsync accepts a\nCancellationToken and does not pass it\non, so a YAML run is not cancellable.",
      "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#991b1b", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0,
      "seed": 250049, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 250050, "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [], "boundElements": null, "link": null, "locked": false,
      "containerId": null, "lineHeight": 1.25 },

